s NOT do#{5}":[135,135],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#III. What this note does NOT do#{6}":[136,137],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#Provenance":[138,145],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#Provenance#{1}":[140,145],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#DOCUMENT METADATA":[146,154],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#DOCUMENT METADATA#{1}":[148,148],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#DOCUMENT METADATA#{2}":[149,149],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#DOCUMENT METADATA#{3}":[150,150],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#DOCUMENT METADATA#{4}":[151,152],"#VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices#DOCUMENT METADATA####[[\"The world is quiet here.\"]]":[153,154]},"outlinks":[{"title":"\"The world is quiet here.\"","target":"\"The world is quiet here.\"","line":153}],"metadata":{"title":"VAULT — Local Offices and Standing Offices (the two scopes of office)","date created":"2026-06-09","updated":"2026-06-10","authority":"LOGAN","doc_class":"doctrine","status":"active","subject":"The vault holds offices at two scopes. A LOCAL office is per-county — each county has its own Count, Judge, Coroner, Sheriff, Cleric, etc., so many hold the same office-title at once (one per county). A STANDING office is vault-wide and held by ONLY ONE at a time — the Abhorsen, the Mogget, etc. This names a distinction the vault already kept scattered; it does not rewrite the Constitution.","related":["CONSTITUTION","!/AGENTS.md",".abhorsen/ABHORSEN.md","CORONER-OF-CLAUDE-COUNTY-OFFICE-WITNESS-2026-06-03","COUNTY-ETYMOLOGY-AND-HISTORY-2026-06-03","IDAHO-COUNTIES-CORONER-AND-SHERIFF-2026-06-03","!/STANDING-ENGINE-AND-LAWFUL-ENDINGS-2026-04-17.md","!/LICH-PROBLEM-v1-2026-05-20.md","RECORD-OF-THE-VAULTED-ABHORSENS-FIRST-DRAFT-2026-05-31","CORONER-FOUNDING-SETTLEMENT-OF-CLAUDE-COUNTY-2026-06-08"],"tags":["#doctrine","#governance","#offices","#local-office","#standing-office","#county","#one-at-a-time","#appointment-not-inheritance","#anti-caesar","#mapping"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},